{"parse": {"title": "BBT-06", "pageid": 88297, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/BBT-05\" title=\"BBT-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">BBT-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/BBT-07\" title=\"BBT-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">BBT</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.A1.8C.E5.9C.A8.E9.80.94.E4.B8.AD\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"行在途中\">行在途中</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 行在途中</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">On the Road Again</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>口<span class=\"color-value\"></span>香<span class=\"color-value\"></span>糖<span class=\"color-value\"></span>？<span class=\"color-value\"></span>加<span class=\"color-value\"></span>油<span class=\"color-value\"></span>站<span class=\"color-value\"></span>？<span class=\"color-value\"></span>还<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>…<span class=\"color-value\"></span>…<span class=\"color-value\"></span>架<span class=\"color-value\"></span>子<span class=\"color-value\"></span>鼓<span class=\"color-value\"></span>？<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 192006</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-waijiejiedao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"waijiejiedao\"><img alt=\"waijiejiedao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-waijiejiedao.png/600px-Cg-waijiejiedao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-waijiejiedao.png/900px-Cg-waijiejiedao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-waijiejiedao.png/1200px-Cg-waijiejiedao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“闪光”莱安娜：</div><div>讲老实话，我们对你不太熟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝斯手踩灭脚边的小小火星，嚼起一块口香糖。身后不远，强尼正挥手向几位背着吉他的年轻人告别。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“闪光”莱安娜：</div><div>但无所谓，一开始我跟其他人也都不认识。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>莱莉是怎么跟你们混到一块儿的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>莱莉小姐此时正忙着在停车场发动引擎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“闪光”莱安娜：</div><div>这你得问强尼。他那时候在酒吧见到莱莉，就凑过去跟人家打招呼，嘿，有兴趣一起搞乐队吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“闪光”莱安娜：</div><div>他就像块口香糖，黏上莱莉。对吧，强尼？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回到卡车旁挥洒汗水的强尼没有搭理伙伴的玩笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“四指”强尼：</div><div>有这个空闲不如过来帮我们搬搬东西！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“闪光”莱安娜：</div><div>我可没空，我跟咱们的新船长有要紧事谈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我也会唱歌，你说是吧，APPLe先生？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>咳、咳咳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不置可否，这是APPLe先生的礼貌体现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“闪光”莱安娜：</div><div>我还以为你打算做一些更酷的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“闪光”莱安娜：</div><div>比如拿着一把枪，像真正的硬茬儿那样去占领操控间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>不。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>本海盗可不会去做这种绑架人质的活儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>作为船长，当然应该——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>嗨——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>在聊我的事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>船长正在和莱安娜小姐商量船员们的任务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-565210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-565210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-565210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>喔？那你们打算让我做什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>占领广播操控间，把我们的声音放给所有人！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-565213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-565213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-565213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-565210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-565210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-565210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>可我去做这件事，谁来握住麦克风呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>听到这里，摇滚海盗露出笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>本海盗会用自己的歌喉震撼所有人，哼哼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>好吧，我很期待你的表演。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>上车，星锑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“闪光”莱安娜：</div><div>嘿，你不打算带上我？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>你和强尼他们不是打算去绕点儿路吗？再说老爷车里可塞不下你的宝贝家伙，自己去跟后面的车！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-chenei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"chenei\"><img alt=\"chenei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-chenei.png/600px-Cg-chenei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-chenei.png/900px-Cg-chenei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-chenei.png/1200px-Cg-chenei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>以前我在电台工作，调调你的收音机，晚上九点就能找到我的频道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-565213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-565213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-565213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>但后来我发现那不是我想要的生活——按部就班，千篇一律，每一天都跟昨天没什么两样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>于是我离开了，和前几年很多冲动的年轻人一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>拿起麦克风，认识了这些朋友。我们组了乐队，后来听说淘金镇颁布了禁止摇滚的规矩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>于是你们就来这儿了，是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>没错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>本海盗很欣赏这种精神！你是个不错的舵手！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我们一起来大闹一场吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>他们禁止，我们就反对！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>哈哈哈哈是的没错，就像这辆车——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>我的酒鬼老爸以前开着它在77号公路上送货——你叫它走私也行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>查尔斯·明格斯、埃尔维斯·普雷斯利……甚至有佛莱迪·摩克瑞，很多很多人的碟片，他都送过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>这辆车里居然能塞这么多东西……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-565210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-565210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-565210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>其实也没那么多，再多就坐不下人了。强尼他们在另一辆大车上，乐器很重的，星锑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>轿车里，摇滚海盗和主唱小姐先行前往“目标地点”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>要是有辆大点儿的车就好了，大家一起走，肯定更安全。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>没事，我们可是有三个人呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>本海盗对抗基金会的围剿时，可是坚持了很久的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她夸耀着自己的“光荣事迹”——曾在森林里的“勇敢”抗争。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>那是本海盗干过最朋克的一件事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>朋克——是这个意思吗，APPLe先生？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>是的，APPLe某认为可以这样理解“朋克”一词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>看来你不是第一次干这种事了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>你不会真的是个海盗吧，星锑？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>本海盗当然是海盗！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-565210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-565210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-565210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>……好吧，现在我相信这是个玩笑了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>尽管如此，船长曾经也真的拥有过自己的船。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>不止一艘哇！两代APPLe号！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一艘毁于泰晤士河上的“炮击”，另一艘则葬身于爱琴海的风浪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-565212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-565212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-565212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>那一定是很让人心痛的损失，让我想起了莱安娜那把被毁掉的旧贝斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>本海盗早晚会有一艘新的船。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>可以通过司辰向基金会申请相关经费，但根据APPLe对相关预算法案的了解来说，船长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>我们得做好最差的预期。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>什么申请经费？你还是一个持证出海的海盗吗？哈哈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>在历史上，我们通常把这叫做“私掠船”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一行三“人”乘车行驶在通往剧场的马路上，形同一艘跨越大海的小舟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>摇滚海盗看起来比掌握方向盘的司机冷静不少——她的手心没有汗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她自顾自地哼唱着——尽管调子与原曲毫无关系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>嘿，伙计，不要沮丧～♪</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>把曾经的悲伤欢快地唱～♪</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>噗哈哈哈，我得说，星锑小姐，要是你做主唱的话，啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>一定能“震撼全场”……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>到啦，下车吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>不错！今晚就让本海盗给大伙儿一个“震撼全场”的精彩演出吧！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "BBT-06"}}